            "id": "f72aac8b-7530-35e6-83ef-1487dd76ff43",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Qualcomm & McDonald's earnings, ADP job data: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> takes a look at the top stories for investors to watch on Wednesday, Nov. 5.</p>\n<p>New York City's mayoral race is underway, with polls to close at 9:00 p.m. on Tuesday.</p>\n<p>Toyota (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TM\">TM</a>), Novo Nordisk (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVO\">NVO</a>), and McDonald's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MCD\">MCD</a>) will report quarterly earnings before the opening bell, while AppLovin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APP\">APP</a>), Qualcomm (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/QCOM\">QCOM</a>), and Robinhood (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HOOD\">HOOD</a>) report after the closing bell.</p>\n<p>ADP (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ADP\">ADP</a>) will release employment data for October.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Market Domination Overtime host Josh Lipton takes a look at the top stories for investors to watch on Wednesday, Nov. 5. New York City's mayoral race is underway, with polls to close at 9:00 p.m. on Tuesday. Toyota (TM), Novo Nordisk (NVO), and McDonald's (MCD) will report quarterly earnings before the opening bell, while AppLovin (APP), Qualcomm (QCOM), and Robinhood (HOOD) report after the closing bell. ADP (ADP) will release employment data for October. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination Overtime.",
